{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-工具\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"创建千川全域控成本计划的调控任务，支持一键起量、素材追投等场景。需配合【获取Access token】、【获取白名单能力】等接口使用。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.control_task.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/ad/control_task/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1825827435645963\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"qianchuan.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"创建调控任务需要先获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"qianchuan.get_whitelist_capability\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1763675121890315\",\"reason\":\"判断是否为白名单用户以支持传入净成交支付ROI\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取白名单能力\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"创建调控任务\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nRkHEoII\">创建调控任务</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1824925787511952%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%22GuQVO%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-q26TshhV\" id=\"h346b9f0-q26TshhV\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-jMpZKjAA\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/ad/control_task/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/ad/control_task/create/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1825827435645963\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-2Rqp3vi1\" id=\"h346b9f0-2Rqp3vi1\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-B2SYMVlB\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JOd2UdTC\" id=\"h346b9f0-JOd2UdTC\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-iZVrmZqn\" id=\"h346b9f0-iZVrmZqn\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">千川投放账户ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ad_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wgvWAEkb\">全域控成本计划id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">name</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">任务名称，1-50个字<p data-id=\"p838747a-phejcUAB\">注意：对于直播全域-一键调速-一键控速场景下不支持设置名称，其余场景下必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">scene</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">调控任务类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-EGCJ5dQA\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3E0EXAL6\"><code>SMART_BOOST</code> 一键起量</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cObNk6S2\"><code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>素材追投</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">smart_bid_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">直播全域素材追投方式 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LuyBhApA\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rkIVqiAN\"><code>SMART_BID_CONSERVATIVE</code> 放量投放</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-r0La72Qb\"><code>SMART_BID_CUSTOM</code> 控成本投放</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-P3i9Lfcg\">注意：当ad_id为直播全域控成本计划&amp;scene=<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>时支持且必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">budget</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\">调控预算，单位元，小数点后两位<p data-id=\"p838747a-FKefBmsm\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sYWF54e1\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-H6njZY6V\">注意：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-FMXPb0WN\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E0FRPAbE\">调控预算不得超过全域计划预算</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TFN2ShnL\">当scene=<code>SMART_BOOST</code>/<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>时必填</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-6QxXwfAY\"></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">duration</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\">调控时长，0.5h～24.0h，步进0.5h<p data-id=\"p838747a-MxbnE7a5\">注意：当ad_id为直播全域控成本计划&amp;scene=<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>&amp; smart_bid_type=<code>SMART_BID_CUSTOM</code> 控成本投放</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bzgs8xrmoc800\">时，不支持设置调控时长，默认是长期有效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_ids</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">素材列表，需要追投的素材ids <p data-id=\"p838747a-f6aeAOes\">注意：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-02GERP48\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MZg3HCoi\">最多支持20个素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-F4WV6TIK\">仅支持视频素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oYVIAaBM\">当scene=<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>必填</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">external_action</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MvHaW3Gm\">直播全域一键起量探索目标</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-UCvHFM6s\"><code>AD_CONVERT_TYPE_LIVE_SUCCESSORDER_PAY</code>直播间购买（直播间成交）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AO10uMlj\"><code>AD_CONVERT_TYPE_LIVE_HEAT</code>直播间人气</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-jIAGs3MJ\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-dxPsAHq4\">直播全域-素材追投-控成本投放-优化目标</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OSvmPtsA\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OLLoIz2L\"><code>AD_CONVERT_TYPE_LIVE_SUCCESSORDER_PAY</code>直播间购买（直播间成交）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RZF2B77j\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-akg4vqjpb8g00\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-gqmsustmwsg00\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0XcobGvT\">注意：ad_id为直播全域控成本计划&amp;scene=<code>SMART_BOOST</code>/scene=<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>&amp;smart_bid_type=<code>SMART_BID_CUSTOM</code>时支持且必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">deep_external_action</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">深度转化目标，允许值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2p21ehx0yme000\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-746Bv5AR\"><code>AD_CONVERT_TYPE_LIVE_PAY_ROI</code> 支付ROI</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-47o1svj4rdk000\"><code>AD_CONVERT_TYPE_LIVE_PURE_PAY_ROI</code> 净成交ROI</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-52ckze67e44000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5nvzjt3i4zg000\">白名单内用户仅支持传入<span style=\"color: #d83931;\">净成交支付ROI</span>，白名单key：<code>assist_pure_roi_allcut</code> ，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1763675121890315\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">获取白名单能力</span></a>】接口判断</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-DPUrGJ6X\">注意：</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-5qihyv2t060000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-34h9mbr8va4000\">当ad_id为直播全域控成本计划scene=<code>MATERIAL_ADD_BUDGET</code>&amp;smart_bid_type=<code>SMART_BID_CUSTOM</code>&amp;external_action=<code>AD_CONVERT_TYPE_LIVE_SUCCESSORDER_PAY</code>时支持</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">roi2_goal</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-184aaviftim800\">直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-ROI目标，单位元，支持范围: 0.01-100，最多两位小数注意：当直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-支付ROI目标时支持且生效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>double</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-37crnci52hk000\">直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-直播间成交的转化出价，支持范围: 0.01-10000，同时预算建议高于5倍出价。</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1mxhptv0puw000\">注意：当直播全域-素材追投-控成本追投-直播间成交时支持且生效</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">room_material_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">直播全域-素材追投-直播间画面素材id<p data-id=\"p838747a-VWMcmLMr\">注意：仅支持直播全域素材追投</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">audience</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">定向人群设置<p data-id=\"p838747a-2EETbtSf\">注意：仅支持直播全域素材追投-控成本追投</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">gender</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">性别 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-b3ig2x0P\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-536CN52i\"><code>GENDER_FEMALE</code>女性</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hV4vf87R\"><code>GENDER_MALE</code>男性 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-S67DyGEf\"><code>NONE</code>不限（默认） </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">age</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">年龄 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-3w7kaODS\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AEABDgmn\"><code>AGE_ABOVE_50</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XVv7ExWH\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_18_23</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RKBY1lyw\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_24_30</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uPvnR0r0\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_31_40</code> </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Z7FB15hH\"><code>AGE_BETWEEN_41_49</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_behaviors</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音用户行为类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-NJKsfVB7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aFWptHwO\"><code>COMMENTED_USER</code> 评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Xs5KBOxy\"><code>FOLLOWED_USER</code> 关注</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QXD4TzUh\"><code>GOODS_CARTS_CLICK</code> 购物车点击</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lZx1tUaX\"><code>GOODS_CARTS_ORDER</code> 购物车下单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZFA9t5Oc\"><code>LIKED_USER</code> 点赞</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WxdAnwH0\"><code>LIVE_COMMENT</code> 直播评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KvAVbJf1\"><code>LIVE_EFFECTIVE_WATCH</code> 直播有效观看</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-U3DSDHZS\"><code>LIVE_EXCEPTIONAL</code> 直播打赏</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HWscqSdD\"><code>LIVE_GOODS_CLICK</code> 直播商品点击</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Re6ty4S1\"><code>LIVE_GOODS_ORDER</code> 直播商品下单</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Uk1OtLwv\"><code>LIVE_WATCH</code> 直播观看</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-fIxQNOr4\"><code>SHARED_USER</code> 分享</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_behaviors_days</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音达人互动用户行为天数 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-mgCSzzWl\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rKQMJnR2\"><code>DAYS_15</code>近15天 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-wtqQLcGL\"><code>DAYS_30</code>近30天 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ceynuLpg\"><code>DAYS_60</code>近60天</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-bywQVZVw\">注意：当抖音用户行为类型仅为<code>关注</code>时，不支持</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-dM7BWNKe\"> </p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_categories</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音达人分类ID列表</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_fan_accounts</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音达人ID列表</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">location_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">地域定向的用户状态类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-VoC4yZPW\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YaVW5G5M\"><code>ALL</code>该地区内的所有用户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JnVRdt7H\"><code>CURRENT</code>正在该地区的用户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gerjuqVT\"><code>HOME</code>居住在该地区的用户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7R1m1hP8\"><code>TRAVEL</code>到该地区旅行的用户 </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">district</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"